# (1) PRE-FIX reproduction (inspeQtor): 'sudo -n bash scripts/s10plus-debug-pack/nuxel-live.sh --run "uname -r" --timeout 15'
#     -> rc=2 with zero bytes of output: GNU ls exited 2 on the macOS-only glob, pipefail propagated it, set -e aborted before the diagnostic.

